SUMMARY:Overcoming Fear on the Path of Self-Mastery II
DESCRIPTION:Rosicrucians AMORC\, Santa Rosa\, CA\nIn the [April 1936 issue
  of the](https://rosicrucian-files.sfo3.digitaloceanspaces.com/Digests/Ros
 icrucian_Digest_Archive/The_Rosicrucian_Digest_v14_n3_1936.pdf)*[Rosicruci
 an Digest](https://rosicrucian-files.sfo3.digitaloceanspaces.com/Digests/R
 osicrucian_Digest_Archive/The_Rosicrucian_Digest_v14_n3_1936.pdf)* there w
 as a very helpful and liberating article by Past Imperator H. Spencer Lewi
 s entitled “Does Fear Enslave You?” We will continue to follow up on t
 hat article and consider ways\, known and unknown to us\, that fear may be
  holding us back in growing\, serving\, and enjoying life. Overcoming fear
  is one of the major ways we mature\, heal\, have greater meaning and purp
 ose in life\, and become fully ourselves. Join Hugh McCague as we continue
  to explore Rosicrucian laws and principles and their creative expression 
 and application for the mastery of life\, harmonious living\, and service.
 \n\n**Please RSVP to access log-in information. Click ATTEND ONLINE below.
 **
