SUMMARY:Wholeheartedly Giving Thanks
DESCRIPTION:Rosicrucians AMORC\, Santa Rosa\, CA\nJoin Julie Scott\, Grand
  Master of the Rosicrucian Order\, in celebrating the many things we have 
 to be grateful for - not just on the fourth Thursday of November - but eve
 ry day! Together we will seek out and extol the glorious bounty\, beauty\,
  and gifts in our lives. Please bring some paper and a pen or colored penc
 ils.\n\n**Please RSVP to access log-in information. Click ATTEND ONLINE be
 low.**
